            "marker": "s1",
            "content": [
                "The Seed Growing Secretly\n"
            ],
            "h": "Mark",
            "vid": "MRK 4:26"
        },
        {
            "type": "para",
            "marker": "p",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "verse",
                    "marker": "v",
                    "number": "26",
                    "sid": "MRK 4:26"
                },
                "Jesus also said, “The kingdom of God is like a man who scatters seed on\nthe ground.\n",
                {
                    "type": "verse",
                    "marker": "v",
                    "number": "27",
                    "sid": "MRK 4:27"
                },
                "Night and day he sleeps and wakes, and the seed sprouts and grows, though\nhe knows not how.\n",
                {
                    "type": "verse",
                    "marker": "v",
                    "number": "28",
                    "sid": "MRK 4:28"
                },
                "All by itself the earth produces a crop—first the stalk, then the head,\nthen grain that ripens within.\n\n"
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "para",
